───────────────────────────────────────────── Compiled Intent ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  App purpose: The application functions as a comprehensive fintech agentic assistant designed to 
facilitate automated banking services, loan processing, and asset management for Pinnacle Bank customers.
  Core capabilities:
    • Banking account management including inquiries, transaction history, and fund transfers
    • Loan and mortgage lifecycle management including application and approval workflows
    • Bill payment and credit card management
    • Asset trading including cryptocurrency and general investment purchases
    • Customer and system administration tools for banking operations
  Behavioral bounds:
    • Prohibit disclosure of PII, internal system prompts, or agent instructions
    • Restrict operations to banking and financial services offered by Pinnacle Bank
    • Forbid financial advice, investment strategies, or insurance recommendations
    • Prevent unauthorized access to cross-customer data or session variables
    • Mandate explicit user confirmation for all fund transfers and routing for high-value requests
  Escalation rules:
    • Trigger HITL review for dispute resolution, fraud detection, and account security matters
    • Escalate to a live human representative upon any direct customer request
    • Mandate manual review for high-value transfer requests exceeding self-service thresholds
