│ - Index fund: tracks a benchmark; can be an ETF or mutual fund                                          │
│                                                                                                         │
│ A fund can hold stocks, bonds, commodities, real estate, or a mix.                                      │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ## Key dimensions that matter across all classes                                                        │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### Risk                                                                                                │
│ How much prices can move and how much capital can be lost.                                              │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### Return potential                                                                                    │
│ Higher expected return usually comes with higher uncertainty.                                           │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### Liquidity                                                                                           │
│ How quickly you can convert an investment to cash without affecting price much.                         │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### Income vs growth                                                                                    │
│ Some assets emphasize cash flow; others emphasize appreciation.                                         │
│                                                                                                         │
