│ - Stocks may lead during expansion                                                                      │
│ - Bonds may help during slowdowns or risk-off periods                                                   │
│ - Commodities may help during inflation shocks                                                          │
│ - Cash provides flexibility and downside buffer                                                         │
│ - Real estate and alternatives may add differentiated exposure                                          │
│                                                                                                         │
│ The goal is often not maximizing return at all times, but balancing growth, resilience, liquidity, and  │
